  eyebrow: "TARES · Swiss customs tariff", hero: "The Swiss customs tariff.", accent: "Line by line.",
  intro: "Every eight-digit tariff number, its descriptions in four languages and every rate row in force, with units, dates and conditions. Weekly scheduled collection from FOCBS (BAZG) files, checked before publication.",
